r the suspects who stole the captain's car.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iHgUyHW8XNy87PW0oDAYFwNu1JZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"King of the Neighborhood\",\"overview\":\"Kike is suspicious of Carcar's gifts, until one of his offers appears irresistible. Abel has an epiphany about where to build his church.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/CU5HZ3N37Lzz1nTI5YuskaueBB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Bad Trip\",\"overview\":\"When Noche looks into the Karmann's steering issues, he makes a shocking discovery. An inquisitive Kike throws a party at Abi's to find answers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xkjcv88UxoWJbGL0tcKUleDTfoa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Guts and Fury\",\"overview\":\"Noche connects with God, but is overwhelmed by guilt. Carcar takes Kike with him while conducting business, dispensing lessons on betrayal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tCLXX8wQX0T6hgcYgxtFlcybrfB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Baptism by Fire\",\"overview\":\"Frightened by Carcar's actions and how close he is getting to Kike, Amparo asks the guys to leave town with her. Noche prepares for his baptism.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xNl9d9NEMDGeiqFu7yNcdX4FRGN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Big One\",\"overview\":\"The time has come for Kike and Abi to face off in the famous race, La Gorda, while they simultaneously attempt to pull off a heist against Carcar.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9b75TdP8a1oaRFMKvrJsBOrSFGj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Double Zero\",\"overview\":\"Carcar tells Kike his suspicions have been aimed at the wrong target. Noche makes plans to escape with Rebeca. Abi seeks her revenge.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bCF2ZaWQfn3fhHADkhkFlXATRax.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-03-16\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}